{"id":"draft-c03-01","category":"数学分析","sub_category":"二重积分","concept":"二重积分与区域","concept_id":"C03","parent_training_ids":["calc-double-integral-004"],"problem":"求二重积分 $\\iint_D xy\\,dxdy$，其中 $D=[0,1]\\times[0,2]$。","solution":"矩形区域上被积函数可分离：$\\iint_D xy\\,dxdy=\\left(\\int_0^1x\\,dx\\right)\\left(\\int_0^2y\\,dy\\right)=\\frac12\\times\\frac{2^2}{2}=\\frac12\\times2=1$。","answer":"积分值为 $1$。","method":"矩形区域分离变量积分","difficulty":"基础","variant_kind":"区域类型变化:矩形区域的分离变量计算(与圆盘几何意义父题不同)","scene_spec":{"objects":["平面坐标系:矩形区域 $D=[0,1]\\times[0,2]$(阴影)","曲面 $z=xy$ 在区域上方的示意","板书:$\\iint_D xy\\,dxdy=(\\int_0^1x\\,dx)(\\int_0^2y\\,dy)$","高亮框:结果 $1$","标签「可分离变量」"],"steps":["第一步:画出矩形区域 $D$,阴影标注。","第二步:展示曲面 $z=xy$ 在区域上方。","第三步:把二重积分拆成两个一元积分之积。","第四步:分别计算两个一元积分。","第五步:高亮结果 $1$。"]},"source":"self-authored","license":"Internal-Research-Use-Only","draft_status":"STAGED_NOT_ADMITTED","strict_review":{"status":"PENDING_NEW_VERSION_REVIEW","source_record_sha256":"71e946772603c473ccbaf56aa40ec85dff0af3ed5a6764af1ce6888b0d1c54c5","math_content_sha256":"9466a1852726c7f12962fff8134ba4b183f220a99b2d60682655d73ffca7b4da","scene_semantic_review":"PENDING","visual_review":"PENDING"},"review_disposition":"MATH_VALID_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE","versioned_id":"codex-scene-completion-v5-draft-c03-01","revision_lineage":{"source_path":"reviews\\2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts\\batch-06\\draft.jsonl","source_sha256":"2685493ba0765d9a8d1f8a1be3e55595e83614f9d6861bc1b87c95e2d4aad8df","original_id":"draft-c03-01","prior_parent_training_ids":["calc-double-integral-004"],"historical_risk_not_reset":true,"prior_corrected_record_sha256":"8cdf013d8a3ccbffe4a23ad866303dc41f0e49870d33c12e8be584ede16d0b0f","previous_hold_reasons":[],"math_correction_notes":[],"revised_in_place":false,"version":"codex-repair-v4-final","additional_recheck_reason":null,"previous_selected_version":{"version":"codex-repair-v3","path":"reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-06/draft-codex-repair-v3.jsonl","sha256":