{"id":"draft-c03-02","category":"数学分析","sub_category":"二重积分","concept":"二重积分与区域","concept_id":"C03","parent_training_ids":["calc-double-integral-004"],"problem":"求二重积分 $\\iint_D x^2\\,dxdy$，其中 $D$ 由 $y=x$、$y=0$、$x=1$ 围成；并换一种积分次序重算验证。","solution":"先对 $y$ 积分：$\\iint_D x^2\\,dxdy=\\int_0^1\\int_0^x x^2\\,dy\\,dx=\\int_0^1 x^3\\,dx=\\frac14$。换序(先对 $x$)：区域改写为 $0\\le y\\le1$，$y\\le x\\le1$，故 $\\iint_D x^2\\,dxdy=\\int_0^1\\int_y^1 x^2\\,dx\\,dy=\\int_0^1\\frac{1-y^3}{3}\\,dy=\\frac{1-\\frac14}{3}=\\frac14$。两种次序结果一致。","answer":"积分值为 $\\frac14$(两种积分次序结果一致)。","method":"三角形区域积分(两种次序对照)","difficulty":"基础","variant_kind":"换积分次序:三角形区域两种次序的对照验证","scene_spec":{"objects":["平面坐标系:三角形区域 $D$(由 $y=x,y=0,x=1$ 围成,阴影)","板书:先对 $y$ 积分的累次积分 $\\int_0^1\\int_0^x x^2\\,dy\\,dx$","板书:换序后的累次积分 $\\int_0^1\\int_y^1 x^2\\,dx\\,dy$","高亮框:两者均得 $\\frac14$","标签「积分次序可交换」"],"steps":["第一步:画出三角形区域并写出边界方程。","第二步:展示先对 $y$ 积分的累次积分并计算。","第三步:改写区域为 $0\\le y\\le1,y\\le x\\le1$,展示换序后的积分。","第四步:计算换序结果,两法均为 $\\frac14$。","第五步:标注积分次序可交换,汇总结论。"]},"source":"self-authored","license":"Internal-Research-Use-Only","draft_status":"STAGED_NOT_ADMITTED","strict_review":{"status":"PENDING_NEW_VERSION_REVIEW","source_record_sha256":"31de4f3bb3967d9b2eb34055b840908d7203d10623667f11973992ac09aa0868","math_content_sha256":"7e845f57515ca7c3ade344d03b8282077df5b9ddf95965d66bf765aca6edf414","scene_semantic_review":"PENDING","visual_review":"PENDING"},"review_disposition":"MATH_VALID_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE","versioned_id":"codex-scene-completion-v5-draft-c03-02","revision_lineage":{"source_path":"reviews\\2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts\\batch-06\\draft.jsonl","source_sha256":"2685493ba0765d9a8d1f8a1be3e55595e83614f9d6861bc1b87c95e2d4aad8df","original_id":"draft-c03-02","prior_parent_training_ids":["calc-double-integral-004"],"historical_risk_not_reset":true,"prior_corrected_record_sha256":"9db1325384a4297a564ed1529feb1373ef5402b24f6626ec7ecf0e1b039e1674","previous_hold_reasons":[],"math_correction_notes":[],"revised_in_place":false,"version":"codex-repair-v4-final","additional_recheck_reason":null,"previous_selected_version":{"version":"codex-repair-v3","path":"reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-06/draft-codex-repair-v3.jsonl","sha256":"4a6de9211a9b74be83e8bdc6a6153ef4c7db3383674bb6d7832a8f0b26fc82bb","versioned_id":"codex-repair-20261005-batch-06-draft-c03-02"},"previous_math_review_binding":{"math_content_sha256":"7e845f57515ca7c3ade344d03b8282077df5b9ddf95965d66bf765aca6edf414","evidence":"reviews/codex-supervision/2026-10-05-batch-repair-execution/exact-reverification.json"}},"review_status":"CODEX_MATH_REVIEW_COMPLETE_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE","admitted":false,"animation_render_verified":false,"training_admitted":false,"render_verified":false,"animation_verified":false}
{"id":"draft-c03-03","category":"数学分析","sub_category":"二重积分","concept":"二重积分与区域","concept_id":"C03","parent_training_ids":["calc-double-integral-004"],"problem":"用极坐标求二重积分 $\\iint_D (x^2+y^2)\\,dxdy$，其中 $D$ 为圆盘 $x^2+y^2\\le4$ 在第一象限的部分。","solution":"极坐标:$x=r\\cos\\theta,y=r\\sin\\theta$,雅可比为 $r$。区域:$0\\le r\\le2$,$0\\le\\theta\\le\\frac{\\pi}{2}$。$\\iint_D (x^2+y^2)\\,dxdy=\\int_0^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}\\int_0^2 r^2\\cdot r\\,dr\\,d\\theta=\\int_0^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}d\\theta\\cdot\\int_0^2 r^3\\,dr=\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\times\\frac{2^4}{4}=\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\times4=2\\pi$。","answer":"积分值为 $2\\pi$。","method":"极坐标变换(雅可比 $r$)","difficulty":"中等","variant_kind":"坐标变换:极坐标与雅可比因子的应用(圆域上径向积)","scene_spec":{"objects":["平面坐标系:第一象限四分之一圆盘(阴影)","板书:极坐标替换 $x=r\\cos\\theta,y=r\\sin\\theta$,雅可比 $r$","板书:$\\int_0^{\\pi/2}\\int_0^2 r^3\\,dr\\,d\\theta$","高亮框:结果 $2\\pi$","标签「极坐标雅可比 $r$」"],"steps":["第一步:画出四分之一圆盘,标注极坐标范围。","第二步:写出极坐标替换与雅可比因子 $r$。","第三步:把被积函数化为 $r^2$,积分化为 $\\int\\int r^3\\,dr\\,d\\theta$。","第四步:分离变量计算,得 $2\\pi$。","第五步:标注极坐标雅可比的来源,汇总结论。"]},"source":"self-authored","license":"Internal-Research-Use-Only","draft_status":"STAGED_NOT_ADMITTED","strict_review":{"status":"PENDING_NEW_VERSION_REVIEW","source_record_sha256":"16775972bf5b6fa365426b61d1e74ee5ed9caefc5080c81ff470018f73cf18f8","math_content_sha256":"d8ecd195b0d12bf36f15d1456477255f66e50266ad38524f13d7d98397e13375","scene_semantic_review":"PENDING","visual_review":"PENDING"},"review_disposition":"MATH_VALID_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE","versioned_id":"codex-scene-completion-v5-draft-c03-03","revision_lineage":{"source_path":"reviews\\2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts\\batch-06\\draft.jsonl","source_sha256":"2685493ba0765d9a8d1f8a1be3e55595e83614f9d6861bc1b87c95e2d4aad8df","original_id":"draft-c03-03","prior_parent_training_ids":["calc-double-integral-004"],"historical_risk_not_reset":true,"prior_corrected_record_sha256":"45f8843503a85d8b2f97e842e11f118bd5723b1a471ce95c9e1a1b91601ee4f9","previous_hold_reasons":[],"math_correction_notes":[],"revised_in_place":false,"version":"codex-repair-v4-final","additional_recheck_reason":null,"previous_selected_version":{"version":"codex-repair-v3","path":"reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-06/draft-codex-repair-v3.jsonl","sha256":"4a6de9211a9b74be83e8bdc6a6153ef4c7db3383674bb6d7832a8f0b26fc82bb","versioned_id":"codex-repair-20261005-batch-06-draft-c03-03"},"previous_math_review_binding":{"math_content_sha256":"d8ecd195b0d12bf36f15d1456477255f66e50266ad38524f13d7d98397e13375","evidence":"reviews/codex-supervision/2026-10-05-batch-repair-execution/exact-reverification.json"}},"review_status":"CODEX_MATH_REVIEW_COMPLETE_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE","admitted":false,"animation_render_verified":false,"training_admitted":false,"render_verified":false,"animation_verified":false}
{"id":"draft-c03-04","category":"数学分析","sub_category":"二重积分","concept":"二重积分与区域","concept_id":"C03","parent_training_ids":["calc-double-integral-004"],"problem":"求二重积分 $\\iint_D y\\,dxdy$，其中 $D$ 为上半圆盘 $x^2+y^2\\le1$，$y\\ge0$；并说明在全圆盘上的积分值及其理由。","solution":"极坐标:$0\\le r\\le1$,$0\\le\\theta\\le\\pi$。$\\iint_D y\\,dxdy=\\int_0^{\\pi}\\int_0^1 (r\\sin\\theta)\\,r\\,dr\\,d\\theta=\\int_0^{\\pi}\\sin\\theta\\,d\\theta\\cdot\\int_0^1 r^2\\,dr=2\\times\\frac13=\\frac23$。(直角坐标验证:$\\int_{-1}^{1}\\int_0^{\\sqrt{1-x^2}}y\\,dy\\,dx=\\int_{-1}^{1}\\frac{1-x^2}{2}\\,dx=\\frac23$。)全圆盘上被积函数 $y$ 关于 $x$ 轴为奇函数,区域关于 $x$ 轴对称,故积分为 $0$。","answer":"上半圆盘上积分为 $\\frac23$;全圆盘上积分为 $0$(奇对称性)。","method":"极坐标+对称性(奇函数抵消)","difficulty":"中等","variant_kind":"对称性与符号:上半圆盘积分与全圆盘奇对称抵消的对照","scene_spec":{"objects":["平面坐标系:上半圆盘(阴影)与全圆盘(虚线轮廓)","板书:极坐标积分 $\\int_0^{\\pi}\\int_0^1 r^2\\sin\\theta\\,dr\\,d\\theta$","高亮框:$\\frac23$","动画:全圆盘上下两半关于 $x$ 轴对称的抵消示意","标签「奇函数+对称区域 ⟹ 积分 0」"],"steps":["第一步:画出上半圆盘,写极坐标范围。","第二步:化为累次积分并分离变量,得 $\\frac23$。","第三步:用直角坐标重算验证,结果一致。","第四步:动画展示全圆盘上下两半的对称抵消。","第五步:总结奇对称性结论:全圆盘积分为 $0$。"]},"source":"self-authored","license":"Internal-Research-Use-Only","draft_status":"STAGED_NOT_ADMITTED","strict_review":{"status":"PENDING_NEW_VERSION_REVIEW","source_record_sha256":"57be58fac112d6192c40f905b3c36e2e560e4eefa28e686cc7afc662e58d7264","math_content_sha256":"34bb6d788f06a3c2f5ff88b1f934b07f7a73cc76fac83496e963d90cfb0b7640","scene_semantic_review":"PENDING","visual_review":"PENDING"},"review_disposition":"MATH_VALID_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE","versioned_id":"codex-scene-completion-v5-draft-c03-04","revision_lineage":{"source_path":"reviews\\2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts\\batch-06\\draft.jsonl","source_sha256":"2685493ba0765d9a8d1f8a1be3e55595e83614f9d6861bc1b87c95e2d4aad8df","original_id":"draft-c03-04","prior_parent_training_ids":["calc-double-integral-004"],"historical_risk_not_reset":true,"prior_corrected_record_sha256":"258646c821d3e4293f06b7d1eb157d0cf41c7459e89446b1cf113a34d487bfaa","previous_hold_reasons":[],"math_correction_notes":[],"revised_in_place":false,"version":"codex-repair-v4-final","additional_recheck_reason":null,"previous_selected_version":{"version":"codex-repair-v3","path":"reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-06/draft-codex-repair-v3.jsonl","sha256":"4a6de9211a9b74be83e8bdc6a6153ef4c7db3383674bb6d7832a8f0b26fc82bb","versioned_id":"codex-repair-20261005-batch-06-draft-c03-04"},"previous_math_review_binding":{"math_content_sha256":"34bb6d788f06a3c2f5ff88b1f934b07f7a73cc76fac83496e963d90cfb0b7640","evidence":"reviews/codex-supervision/2026-10-05-batch-repair-execution/exact-reverification.json"}},"review_status":"CODEX_MATH_REVIEW_COMPLETE_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE","admitted":false,"animation_render_verified":false,"training_admitted":false,"render_verified":false,"animation_verified":false}
{"id":"draft-c03-05","category":"数学分析","sub_category":"二重积分","concept":"二重积分与区域","concept_id":"C03","parent_training_ids":["calc-double-integral-004"],"problem":"用变量替换 $u=x+y$，$v=x-y$ 求二重积分 $\\iint_D (x+y)\\,dxdy$，其中 $D=[0,1]\\times[0,1]$。","solution":"雅可比:$\\frac{\\partial(u,v)}{\\partial(x,y)}=\\begin{vmatrix}1&1\\\\1&-1\\end{vmatrix}=-2$,故 $dxdy=\\frac12\\,du\\,dv$。区域变换:由 $x=\\frac{u+v}{2},y=\\frac{u-v}{2}$ 与 $0\\le x,y\\le1$ 得 $0\\le u\\le2$,且当 $0\\le u\\le1$ 时 $-u\\le v\\le u$;当 $1\\le u\\le2$ 时 $u-2\\le v\\le2-u$(菱形)。于是 $\\iint_D(x+y)\\,dxdy=\\int_0^1\\int_{-u}^{u}\\frac{u}{2}\\,dv\\,du+\\int_1^2\\int_{u-2}^{2-u}\\frac{u}{2}\\,dv\\,du=\\int_0^1u^2\\,du+\\int_1^2(2u-u^2)\\,du=\\frac13+\\left(\\left.u^2-\\frac{u^3}{3}\\right|_1^2\\right)=\\frac13+\\left[(4-\\frac83)-(1-\\frac13)\\right]=\\frac13+\\frac23=1$。直角坐标直算验证:$\\int_0^1\\int_0^1(x+y)\\,dx\\,dy=\\int_0^1(\\frac12+y)\\,dy=1$。","answer":"积分值为 $1$(雅可比 $\\frac12$,菱形区域分两段)。","method":"一般变量替换(雅可比+区域变换)","difficulty":"进阶","variant_kind":"结构升级:线性变量替换的雅可比与菱形区域分段,与直角坐标直算互验","scene_spec":{"objects":["平面坐标系:正方形区域 $D=[0,1]\\times[0,1]$ 与指向 $(u,v)$ 平面菱形区域的变换箭头","替换公式板书卡:$u=x+y$、$v=x-y$;反解 $x=\\frac{u+v}{2}$、$y=\\frac{u-v}{2}$","雅可比行列式卡:$\\frac{\\partial(u,v)}{\\partial(x,y)}=\\begin{vmatrix}1&1\\\\1&-1\\end{vmatrix}$,逐项偏导数标注 $\\frac{\\partial u}{\\partial x}=1$、$\\frac{\\partial u}{\\partial y}=1$、$\\frac{\\partial v}{\\partial x}=1$、$\\frac{\\partial v}{\\partial y}=-1$","行列式展开注释卡:$1\\times(-1)-1\\times1=-1-1=-2$;绝对值与倒数:$|J|=|-2|=2$,得 $dxdy=\\frac{1}{2}\\,du\\,dv$","区域推导板书卡:$0\\le u+v\\le2$、$0\\le u-v\\le2$ 两式相加得 $0\\le u\\le2$;分段 $v$ 限:$0\\le u\\le1$ 时 $-u\\le v\\le u$;$1\\le u\\le2$ 时 $u-2\\le v\\le2-u$","$(u,v)$ 平面菱形区域图:按 $u$ 分 $[0,1]$ 与 $[1,2]$ 两段的高亮分界","累次积分公式卡:$\\iint_D(x+y)\\,dxdy=\\int_{0}^{1}\\int_{-u}^{u}\\frac{u}{2}\\,dv\\,du+\\int_1^2\\int_{u-2}^{2-u}\\frac{u}{2}\\,dv\\,du$","内层积分计算卡①:$\\int_{-u}^{u}\\frac{u}{2}\\,dv=\\left.\\frac{u}{2}v\\right|_{-u}^{u}=\\frac{u}{2}[u-(-u)]=\\frac{u}{2}\\cdot2u=u^2$","内层积分计算卡②:$\\int_{u-2}^{2-u}\\frac{u}{2}\\,dv=\\left.\\frac{u}{2}v\\right|_{u-2}^{2-u}=\\frac{u}{2}(4-2u)=2u-u^2$","外层积分计算卡①:$\\int_{0}^{1}u^2\\,du=\\left.\\frac{u^3}{3}\\right|_0^1=\\frac{1}{3}-0=\\frac{1}{3}$","外层积分计算卡②:$\\left.\\left(u^2-\\frac{u^3}{3}\\right)\\right|_1^2=\\left(4-\\frac{8}{3}\\right)-\\left(1-\\frac{1}{3}\\right)=\\frac{4}{3}-\\frac{2}{3}=\\frac{2}{3}$","求和结果高亮框:$\\frac{1}{3}+\\frac{2}{3}=1$","直角坐标验证板书卡:内层 $\\left.\\left(\\frac{x^2}{2}+xy\\right)\\right|_0^1=\\frac{1}{2}+y$;外层 $\\left.\\left(\\frac{y}{2}+\\frac{y^2}{2}\\right)\\right|_0^1=1$","结论高亮框:两法一致,结果 $1$"],"steps":["第一步:画出正方形区域与线性变换的几何示意。①在 $(x,y)$ 平面画出正方形区域 $D=[0,1]\\times[0,1]$,标注顶点坐标;②板书变量替换 $u=x+y$、$v=x-y$,及反解 $x=\\frac{u+v}{2}$、$y=\\frac{u-v}{2}$;③用变换箭头示意:正方形将映到 $(u,v)$ 平面上的菱形区域。","第二步:计算雅可比行列式,逐步展示展开与取倒数。①写出偏导数矩阵 $\\frac{\\partial(u,v)}{\\partial(x,y)}=\\begin{vmatrix}1&1\\\\1&-1\\end{vmatrix}$,逐项标注 $\\frac{\\partial u}{\\partial x}=1$、$\\frac{\\partial u}{\\partial y}=1$、$\\frac{\\partial v}{\\partial x}=1$、$\\frac{\\partial v}{\\partial y}=-1$;②按 2×2 行列式展开(主对角线两元素乘积 $-$ 副对角线两元素乘积):$1\\times(-1)-1\\times1=-1-1=-2$;③取绝对值 $|J|=|-2|=2$,再取倒数,得 $dxdy=\\frac{1}{|J|}\\,du\\,dv=\\frac{1}{2}\\,du\\,dv$。","第三步:推导 $(u,v)$ 平面的菱形区域,说明需按 $u$ 分两段。①把 $x=\\frac{u+v}{2}$、$y=\\frac{u-v}{2}$ 代入 $0\\le x\\le1$ 与 $0\\le y\\le1$,得 $0\\le u+v\\le2$、$0\\le u-v\\le2$;②两式相加得 $0\\le2u\\le4$,即 $0\\le u\\le2$;③分段写 $v$ 的上下限:当 $0\\le u\\le1$ 时 $-u\\le v\\le u$;当 $1\\le u\\le2$ 时 $u-2\\le v\\le2-u$(菱形);④高亮菱形区域,标注需按 $u$ 分 $[0,1]$ 与 $[1,2]$ 两段积分。","第四步:分段积分,逐项展示内层、外层的代入计算。①改写被积式:由 $x+y=u$ 与 $dxdy=\\frac{1}{2}\\,du\\,dv$ 得 $(x+y)\\,dxdy=\\frac{u}{2}\\,du\\,dv$,写出 $\\iint_D(x+y)\\,dxdy=\\int_{0}^{1}\\int_{-u}^{u}\\frac{u}{2}\\,dv\\,du+\\int_1^2\\int_{u-2}^{2-u}\\frac{u}{2}\\,dv\\,du$;②第一段内层积分($\\frac{u}{2}$ 对 $v$ 是常数,先积 $v$ 再代限):$\\int_{-u}^{u}\\frac{u}{2}\\,dv=\\left.\\frac{u}{2}v\\right|_{-u}^{u}=\\frac{u}{2}[u-(-u)]=\\frac{u}{2}\\cdot2u=u^2$;③第二段内层积分:$\\int_{u-2}^{2-u}\\frac{u}{2}\\,dv=\\left.\\frac{u}{2}v\\right|_{u-2}^{2-u}=\\frac{u}{2}[(2-u)-(u-2)]=\\frac{u}{2}(4-2u)=2u-u^2$;④第一段外层积分:$\\int_{0}^{1}u^2\\,du=\\left.\\frac{u^3}{3}\\right|_0^1=\\frac{1}{3}-0=\\frac{1}{3}$;⑤第二段外层积分:$\\int_1^2(2u-u^2)\\,du=\\left.\\left(u^2-\\frac{u^3}{3}\\right)\\right|_1^2=\\left(4-\\frac{8}{3}\\right)-\\left(1-\\frac{1}{3}\\right)=\\frac{4}{3}-\\frac{2}{3}=\\frac{2}{3}$;⑥两段相加:$\\frac{1}{3}+\\frac{2}{3}=1$。","第五步:直角坐标直算验证,两法一致。①写出直角坐标累次积分 $\\int_{0}^{1}\\int_{0}^{1}(x+y)\\,dx\\,dy$;②内层对 $x$ 积分(把 $y$ 当常数):$\\int_{0}^{1}(x+y)\\,dx=\\left.\\left(\\frac{x^2}{2}+xy\\right)\\right|_0^1=\\left(\\frac{1}{2}+y\\right)-0=\\frac{1}{2}+y$;③外层对 $y$ 积分:$\\int_{0}^{1}\\left(\\frac{1}{2}+y\\right)\\,dy=\\left.\\left(\\frac{y}{2}+\\frac{y^2}{2}\\right)\\right|_0^1=\\left(\\frac{1}{2}+\\frac{1}{2}\\right)-0=1$;④高亮两法一致:变量替换得 $1$,直算也得 $1$,答案 $1$。"]},"source":"self-authored","license":"Internal-Research-Use-Only","draft_status":"STAGED_NOT_ADMITTED","strict_review":{"status":"PENDING_NEW_VERSION_REVIEW","source_record_sha256":"b206215ac653e1e441d53c4be7645bceadab4f1e20092c018dd4fa4506115237","math_content_sha256":"09a42340249a034d76bef12c1094a4c9b5a58b038c42023551b13e4cfabc78d7","scene_semantic_review":"PENDING","visual_review":"PENDING"},"review_disposition":"MATH_VALID_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE","versioned_id":"codex-scene-completion-v5-draft-c03-05","revision_lineage":{"source_path":"reviews\\2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts\\batch-06\\draft.jsonl","source_sha256":"2685493ba0765d9a8d1f8a1be3e55595e83614f9d6861bc1b87c95e2d4aad8df","original_id":"draft-c03-05","prior_parent_training_ids":["calc-double-integral-004"],"historical_risk_not_reset":true,"prior_corrected_record_sha256":"ed3d55636c16b95343bce0fa08cdfe54fe6aca57afc83ed296450bfa03d99bdc","previous_hold_reasons":[],"math_correction_notes":[],"revised_in_place":false,"version":"codex-repair-v4-final","additional_recheck_reason":null,"previous_selected_version":{"version":"codex-repair-v3","path":"reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-06/draft-codex-repair-v3.jsonl","sha256":"4a6de9211a9b74be83e8bdc6a6153ef4c7db3383674bb6d7832a8f0b26fc82bb","versioned_id":"codex-repair-20261005-batch-06-draft-c03-05"},"previous_math_review_binding":{"math_content_sha256":"70b408da6f6d47fd4921ee25cec9a52c430c3d72a43233d28357dfedfd3acdc2","evidence":"reviews/codex-supervision/2026-10-05-batch-repair-execution/exact-reverification.json"}},"review_status":"CODEX_MATH_REVIEW_COMPLETE_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE","admitted":false,"animation_render_verified":false,"training_admitted":false,"render_verified":false,"animation_verified":false}
{"id":"draft-c05-01","category":"数学分析","sub_category":"函数极限","concept":"函数极限","concept_id":"C05","parent_training_ids":["calc-limit-006"],"problem":"求极限 $\\lim_{x\\to\\infty}\\frac{x^2+3x+1}{2x^2-x+5}$。","solution":"分子分母同除以最高次项 $x^2$:$\\frac{x^2+3x+1}{2x^2-x+5}=\\frac{1+\\frac3x+\\frac1{x^2}}{2-\\frac1x+\\frac5{x^2}}$。当 $x\\to\\infty$ 时,$\\frac3x,\\frac1x,\\frac1{x^2},\\frac5{x^2}$ 均趋于 $0$,故极限为 $\\frac{1}{2}$。","answer":"极限为 $\\frac12$。","method":"最高次项主导法","difficulty":"基础","variant_kind":"增长类型:多项式比值的主导项分析(与三角函数极限父题不同)","scene_spec":{"objects":["板书:分式 $\\frac{x^2+3x+1}{2x^2-x+5}$","板书:分子分母同除 $x^2$ 的变形","动画:低阶项系数随 $x$ 增大逐渐「缩水」的示意","高亮框:$\\frac12$","标签「最高次项主导」"],"steps":["第一步:写出分式,标出分子分母的最高次项。","第二步:同除以 $x^2$,展示各项变形。","第三步:说明低阶项趋于 $0$。","第四步:高亮极限 $\\frac12$。","第五步:总结最高次项主导的原则。"]},"source":"self-authored","license":"Internal-Research-Use-Only","draft_status":"STAGED_NOT_ADMITTED","strict_review":{"status":"PENDING_NEW_VERSION_REVIEW","source_record_sha256":"9ddf0e1476869da45bf7d0b7429ec7d74d381283cde81733ef6eda1774dcfb8b","math_content_sha256":"cd9317584cee8d5c7b79116db06e0c5b323f6c52e22ef1b06da8cbb13855bd1f","scene_semantic_review":"PENDING","visual_review":"PENDING"},"review_disposition":"MATH_VALID_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE","versioned_id":"codex-scene-completion-v5-draft-c05-01","revision_lineage":{"source_path":"reviews\\2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts\\batch-06\\draft.jsonl","source_sha256":"2685493ba0765d9a8d1f8a1be3e55595e83614f9d6861bc1b87c95e2d4aad8df","original_id":"draft-c05-01","prior_parent_training_ids":["calc-limit-006"],"historical_risk_not_reset":true,"prior_corrected_record_sha256":"d3ca183bebe52e9b1c79d99674fcc8c0b6f380dbfb1263cf18cd0a8e93ac6542","previous_hold_reasons":[],"math_correction_notes":[],"revised_in_place":false,"version":"codex-repair-v4-final","additional_recheck_reason":null,"previous_selected_version":{"version":"codex-repair-v3","path":"reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-06/draft-codex-repair-v3.jsonl","sha256":"4a6de9211a9b74be83e8bdc6a6153ef4c7db3383674bb6d7832a8f0b26fc82bb","versioned_id":"codex-repair-20261005-batch-06-draft-c05-01"},"previous_math_review_binding":{"math_content_sha256":"cd9317584cee8d5c7b79116db06e0c5b323f6c52e22ef1b06da8cbb13855bd1f","evidence":"reviews/codex-supervision/2026-10-05-batch-repair-execution/exact-reverification.json"}},"review_status":"CODEX_MATH_REVIEW_COMPLETE_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE","admitted":false,"animation_render_verified":false,"training_admitted":false,"render_verified":false,"animation_verified":false}
{"id":"draft-c05-02","category":"数学分析","sub_category":"函数极限","concept":"函数极限","concept_id":"C05","parent_training_ids":["calc-limit-006"],"problem":"求 $\\lim_{x\\to0^+}\\frac{|x|}{x}$ 与 $\\lim_{x\\to0^-}\\frac{|x|}{x}$，并判断 $\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{|x|}{x}$ 是否存在。","solution":"当 $x>0$ 时,$|x|=x$,故 $\\frac{|x|}{x}=1$,右极限为 $1$。当 $x<0$ 时,$|x|=-x$,故 $\\frac{|x|}{x}=-1$,左极限为 $-1$。左右极限不相等,故 $\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{|x|}{x}$ 不存在。","answer":"右极限 $1$,左极限 $-1$;$\\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{|x|}{x}$ 不存在。","method":"单侧极限对比","difficulty":"基础","variant_kind":"单侧极限:左右极限不等导致极限不存在(含绝对值分支)","scene_spec":{"objects":["平面坐标系:函数 $\\frac{|x|}{x}$ 的图像(右半直线 $y=1$,左半直线 $y=-1$)","两个空心圆点:$(0,1)$ 与 $(0,-1)$","动画:从右侧与左侧分别趋近 $x=0$ 的箭头","板书:右极限 $1$,左极限 $-1$","红色标签「极限不存在」"],"steps":["第一步:画出函数图像,两段水平线在原点处断开。","第二步:从右侧趋近,展示右极限为 $1$。","第三步:从左侧趋近,展示左极限为 $-1$。","第四步:对比左右极限,不相等。","第五步:红色标注极限不存在,汇总结论。"]},"source":"self-authored","license":"Internal-Research-Use-Only","draft_status":"STAGED_NOT_ADMITTED","strict_review":{"status":"PENDING_NEW_VERSION_REVIEW","source_record_sha256":"e44e650357c57788c4ac69e9f151d9661fc8cbaaa235132fb2ba20d0a108c943","math_content_sha256":"19f7ed9cd2fa1bd86e6567a9c30fce984ed316ec9d7271f36ef1bc59aad49e45","scene_semantic_review":"PENDING","visual_review":"PENDING"},"review_disposition":"MATH_VALID_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE","versioned_id":"codex-scene-completion-v5-draft-c05-02","revision_lineage":{"source_path":"reviews\\2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts\\batch-06\\draft.jsonl","source_sha256":"2685493ba0765d9a8d1f8a1be3e55595e83614f9d6861bc1b87c95e2d4aad8df","original_id":"draft-c05-02","prior_parent_training_ids":["calc-limit-006"],"historical_risk_not_reset":true,"prior_corrected_record_sha256":"5316f6f48025c144deb8fbad15d03dfcdbbea92ecdb2b5e599d8fe26c46e9875","previous_hold_reasons":[],"math_correction_notes":[],"revised_in_place":false,"version":"codex-repair-v4-final","additional_recheck_reason":null,"previous_selected_version":{"version":"codex-repair-v3","path":"reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-06/draft-codex-repair-v3.jsonl","sha256":"4a6de9211a9b74be83e8bdc6a6153ef4c7db3383674bb6d7832a8f0b26fc82bb","versioned_id":"codex-repair-20261005-batch-06-draft-c05-02"},"previous_math_review_binding":{"math_content_sha256":"19f7ed9cd2fa1bd86e6567a9c30fce984ed316ec9d7271f36ef1bc59aad49e45","evidence":"reviews/codex-supervision/2026-10-05-batch-repair-execution/exact-reverification.json"}},"review_status":"CODEX_MATH_REVIEW_COMPLETE_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE","admitted":false,"animation_render_verified":false,"training_admitted":false,"render_verified":false,"animation_verified":false}
{"id":"draft-c05-03","category":"数学分析","sub_category":"函数极限","concept":"函数极限","concept_id":"C05","parent_training_ids":["calc-limit-006"],"problem":"求极限 $\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}\\left(\\sqrt{x^2+2x}-x\\right)$。","solution":"分子有理化(当 $x>0$ 时):$\\sqrt{x^2+2x}-x=\\frac{(x^2+2x)-x^2}{\\sqrt{x^2+2x}+x}=\\frac{2x}{\\sqrt{x^2+2x}+x}=\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{1+\\frac2x}+1}$(分子分母同除以 $x$,$x>0$ 时 $\\sqrt{x^2+2x}=x\\sqrt{1+\\frac2x}$)。当 $x\\to+\\infty$ 时,$\\frac2x\\to0$,极限为 $\\frac{2}{\\sqrt1+1}=1$。","answer":"极限为 $1$。","method":"分子有理化(无穷减无穷消主项)","difficulty":"中等","variant_kind":"消去主项:无穷减无穷型的有理化处理","scene_spec":{"objects":["板书:$\\sqrt{x^2+2x}-x$(标出两个无穷大项)","板书:有理化变形 $\\frac{2x}{\\sqrt{x^2+2x}+x}$","板书:同除 $x$ 得 $\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{1+\\frac2x}+1}$","高亮框:$1$","标签「有理化消主项」"],"steps":["第一步:写出表达式,标注两无穷大项相减。","第二步:分子有理化,展示平方差变形。","第三步:分子分母同除 $x$。","第四步:令 $\\frac2x\\to0$,得极限 $1$。","第五步:总结有理化消主项的方法。"]},"source":"self-authored","license":"Internal-Research-Use-Only","draft_status":"STAGED_NOT_ADMITTED","strict_review":{"status":"PENDING_NEW_VERSION_REVIEW","source_record_sha256":"9e7c7b0e1302b7ec8ed120f31b5080b935cd91d319b0b86002f35c475b69b05b","math_content_sha256":"49396318c60054593cd054755c641d061f30883c65af0f2c99a19d5754d34600","scene_semantic_review":"PENDING","visual_review":"PENDING"},"review_disposition":"MATH_VALID_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE","versioned_id":"codex-scene-completion-v5-draft-c05-03","revision_lineage":{"source_path":"reviews\\2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts\\batch-06\\draft.jsonl","source_sha256":"2685493ba0765d9a8d1f8a1be3e55595e83614f9d6861bc1b87c95e2d4aad8df","original_id":"draft-c05-03","prior_parent_training_ids":["calc-limit-006"],"historical_risk_not_reset":true,"prior_corrected_record_sha256":"e46d13239800322634da48e753544331efe985c8fffff13eab3f614afeef94af","previous_hold_reasons":[],"math_correction_notes":[],"revised_in_place":false,"version":"codex-repair-v4-final","additional_recheck_reason":null,"previous_selected_version":{"version":"codex-repair-v3","path":"reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-06/draft-codex-repair-v3.jsonl","sha256":"4a6de9211a9b74be83e8bdc6a6153ef4c7db3383674bb6d7832a8f0b26fc82bb","versioned_id":"codex-repair-20261005-batch-06-draft-c05-03"},"previous_math_review_binding":{"math_content_sha256":"49396318c60054593cd054755c641d061f30883c65af0f2c99a19d5754d34600","evidence":"reviews/codex-supervision/2026-10-05-batch-repair-execution/exact-reverification.json"}},"review_status":"CODEX_MATH_REVIEW_COMPLETE_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE","admitted":false,"animation_render_verified":false,"training_admitted":false,"render_verified":false,"animation_verified":false}
{"id":"draft-c05-04","category":"数学分析","sub_category":"函数极限","concept":"函数极限","concept_id":"C05","parent_training_ids":["calc-limit-006"],"problem":"求 $\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}\\frac{x^3}{e^x}$ 与 $\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}\\frac{\\ln x}{\\sqrt{x}}$，并说明它们反映的增长等级关系。","solution":"对$x\\to+\\infty$，三个指数比值均为$\\infty/\\infty$型，各阶段分母导数$e^x>0$，洛必达法则给出$\\lim x^3/e^x=\\lim3x^2/e^x=\\lim6x/e^x=\\lim6/e^x=0$。同理$\\ln x/\\sqrt x$为$\\infty/\\infty$型，$\\lim\\ln x/\\sqrt x=\\lim(1/x)/(1/(2\\sqrt x))=\\lim2/\\sqrt x=0$。另有$\\lim\\sqrt x/x^3=\\lim x^{-5/2}=0$。所以增长次序用严格比值极限表示为$\\lim x^3/e^x=\\lim\\sqrt x/x^3=\\lim\\ln x/\\sqrt x=0$，以上极限均为$x\\to+\\infty$。","answer":"两个极限均为$0$；严格增长关系为$\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}\\frac{x^3}{e^x}=\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}\\frac{\\sqrt x}{x^3}=\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}\\frac{\\ln x}{\\sqrt x}=0$。","method":"洛必达法则(跨类型增长对比)","difficulty":"中等","variant_kind":"增长类型对比:指数/多项式/对数三类增长的极限与等级排序","scene_spec":{"objects":["三次洛必达的精确极限链","$\\lim\\ln x/\\sqrt x=0$，$\\lim\\sqrt x/x^3=0$","图像只作示意，排序依据为比值极限"],"steps":["第一步：检查无穷比无穷型和分母导数非零。","第二步：逐次洛必达计算指数比值。","第三步：计算对数比值及两个幂函数的比值。","第四步：用三个精确比值极限表达增长次序。"]},"source":"self-authored","license":"Internal-Research-Use-Only","draft_status":"STAGED_NOT_ADMITTED","strict_review":{"status":"PENDING_NEW_VERSION_REVIEW","source_record_sha256":"8abc5e7c1ec8ac8245db4d4c16264b45d3b06684569d7578868e98649a799131","math_content_sha256":"da734db0ca027022ec39b3eb50dafcef9c14d95640d2ca95a18367b5002a345f","scene_semantic_review":"PENDING","visual_review":"PENDING"},"review_disposition":"MATH_VALID_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE","versioned_id":"codex-scene-completion-v5-draft-c05-04","revision_lineage":{"source_path":"reviews\\2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts\\batch-06\\draft.jsonl","source_sha256":"2685493ba0765d9a8d1f8a1be3e55595e83614f9d6861bc1b87c95e2d4aad8df","original_id":"draft-c05-04","prior_parent_training_ids":["calc-limit-006"],"historical_risk_not_reset":true,"prior_corrected_record_sha256":"282806f7f609c5bb3e3023b4ceb949593c1657cdc1aa85390af64ddfb7ed6f75","previous_hold_reasons":[],"math_correction_notes":["增长关系用精确比值极限替代未定义的远大于符号，补洛必达适用条件"],"revised_in_place":false,"version":"codex-repair-v4-final","additional_recheck_reason":null,"previous_selected_version":{"version":"codex-repair-v3","path":"reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-06/draft-codex-repair-v3.jsonl","sha256":"4a6de9211a9b74be83e8bdc6a6153ef4c7db3383674bb6d7832a8f0b26fc82bb","versioned_id":"codex-repair-20261005-batch-06-draft-c05-04"},"previous_math_review_binding":{"math_content_sha256":"da734db0ca027022ec39b3eb50dafcef9c14d95640d2ca95a18367b5002a345f","evidence":"reviews/codex-supervision/2026-10-05-batch-repair-execution/exact-reverification.json"}},"review_status":"CODEX_MATH_REVIEW_COMPLETE_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE","admitted":false,"animation_render_verified":false,"training_admitted":false,"render_verified":false,"animation_verified":false}
{"id":"draft-c05-05","category":"数学分析","sub_category":"函数极限","concept":"函数极限","concept_id":"C05","parent_training_ids":["calc-limit-006"],"problem":"证明 $\\lim_{x\\to0}\\sin\\frac{1}{x}$ 不存在。","solution":"取两个趋于 $0$ 的数列:$x_n=\\frac{1}{2n\\pi}$,则 $x_n\\to0$ 且 $\\sin\\frac{1}{x_n}=\\sin(2n\\pi)=0\\to0$。再取 $y_n=\\frac{1}{2n\\pi+\\frac{\\pi}{2}}$,则 $y_n\\to0$ 且 $\\sin\\frac{1}{y_n}=\\sin(2n\\pi+\\frac{\\pi}{2})=1\\to1$。两个数列都趋于 $0$,但函数值分别趋于 $0$ 与 $1$。由海涅定理(归结原则),若 $\\lim_{x\\to0}\\sin\\frac1x$ 存在,则沿任何趋于 $0$ 的数列函数值应收敛到同一极限,矛盾。故极限不存在。","answer":"极限不存在(取 $x_n=\\frac{1}{2n\\pi}$ 与 $y_n=\\frac{1}{2n\\pi+\\frac\\pi2}$ 两列,函数值分别趋于 $0$ 与 $1$,由海涅定理得矛盾)。","method":"海涅定理反证(两列逼近不同值)","difficulty":"进阶","variant_kind":"证明型:极限不存在性的严格证明(归结原则+双数列),非计算","scene_spec":{"objects":["平面坐标系:函数 $\\sin\\frac1x$ 在原点附近的振荡图像(振荡加密动画)","红色数列点:$x_n=\\frac{1}{2n\\pi}$ 处的函数值 $0$(沿 $x$ 轴)","蓝色数列点:$y_n=\\frac{1}{2n\\pi+\\frac\\pi2}$ 处的函数值 $1$(上沿)","板书:海涅定理的表述","红色标签「极限不存在」"],"steps":["第一步:画出 $\\sin\\frac1x$ 的振荡图像,展示原点附近振荡无限加密。","第二步:取红色数列 $x_n=\\frac{1}{2n\\pi}$,函数值恒为 $0$。","第三步:取蓝色数列 $y_n$,函数值恒为 $1$。","第四步:引用海涅定理:若极限存在则两列函数值应同敛,矛盾。","第五步:红色标注极限不存在,完成证明。"]},"source":"self-authored","license":"Internal-Research-Use-Only","draft_status":"STAGED_NOT_ADMITTED","strict_review":{"status":"PENDING_NEW_VERSION_REVIEW","source_record_sha256":"f056526f10f0b0ab9a6809a87a10fc479237368a145d9698920632e266c54ad9","math_content_sha256":"2f676c7027ed19bd5bdf734c999cf2870262a8e19c52a68db3244f49dd7b43f6","scene_semantic_review":"PENDING","visual_review":"PENDING"},"review_disposition":"MATH_VALID_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE","versioned_id":"codex-scene-completion-v5-draft-c05-05","revision_lineage":{"source_path":"reviews\\2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts\\batch-06\\draft.jsonl","source_sha256":"2685493ba0765d9a8d1f8a1be3e55595e83614f9d6861bc1b87c95e2d4aad8df","original_id":"draft-c05-05","prior_parent_training_ids":["calc-limit-006"],"historical_risk_not_reset":true,"prior_corrected_record_sha256":"5f382ed8ae60f2c8bc7