{"id":"draft-c46-01","category":"概率论","sub_category":"几何概型","concept":"几何概型","concept_id":"C46","parent_training_ids":["prob-039"],"problem":"$X,Y$相互独立且均匀分布于$[0,1]$。用单位正方形中的面积计算$P(XY\\le1/4)$，并说明积分区间的分段依据。","solution":"联合密度为单位正方形上的$1$，事件概率等于区域面积。当$0\\le x\\le1/4$，所有$0\\le y\\le1$满足$xy\\le1/4$；当$1/4<x\\le1$，须$0\\le y\\le1/(4x)$。边界面积为零，故$P=\\int_0^{1/4}1\\,dx+\\int_{1/4}^{1}\\frac1{4x}\\,dx=1/4+(\\ln4)/4=1/4+(\\ln2)/2$。分段点来自双曲线与上边界$y=1$的交点$x=1/4$；若全区间都用$1/(4x)$会超出样本空间且产生伪发散。","answer":"$P(XY\\le1/4)=\\frac14+\\frac12\\ln2$。","method":"乘积事件的双曲线区域面积","difficulty":"基础","variant_kind":"非线性边界+样本空间截断+精确对数","scene_spec":{"objects":["单位正方形与$xy=1/4$","分段$x=1/4$","区域面积$1/4+(\\ln2)/2$"],"steps":["第一步:写出联合均匀密度及几何事件。","第二步:求双曲线与正方形边界交点。","第三步:分段积分面积。","第四步:保留精确分数与对数。"]},"source":"self-authored","license":"Internal-Research-Use-Only","draft_status":"STAGED_NOT_ADMITTED","strict_review":{"status":"PENDING_NEW_VERSION_REVIEW","source_record_sha256":"81c8aadebb5cad609f62c304703cac48e576061b58ceee1e025f6cddedccd4bd","math_content_sha256":"640a93fba01e37f15d6e28ea4ed3eb0a5ffbed9af995295113cc6dd5135b6344","scene_semantic_review":"PENDING","visual_review":"PENDING"},"review_disposition":"MATH_VALID_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE","versioned_id":"codex-scene-completion-v5-draft-c46-01","revision_lineage":{"source_path":"reviews\\2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts\\batch-06\\draft.jsonl","source_sha256":"2685493ba0765d9a8d1f8a1be3e55595e83614f9d6861bc1b87c95e2d4aad8df","original_id":"draft-c46-01","prior_parent_training_ids":["prob-039"],"historical_risk_not_reset":true,"prior_corrected_record_sha256":"f0d4a4ec93e1c2e240b652f24f327266c0a3dc62c457821e689574d79b55fe08","previous_hold_reasons":["WITHIN_BATCH_VARIANT_CLUSTER_REVIEW"],"math_correction_notes":["题干补独立均匀假设；仅“随机到达”不能推出联合均匀"],"revised_in_place":true,"version":"codex-repair-v4-final","additional_recheck_reason":null,"previous_selected_version":{"version":"codex-repair-v3","path":"reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-06/draft-codex-repair-v3.jsonl","sha256":"4a6de9211a9b74be83e8bdc6a6153ef4c7db3383674bb6d7832a8f0b26fc82bb","versioned_id":"codex-repair-20261005-batch-06-draft-c46-01"},"previous_math_review_binding":{"math_content_sha256":"f3d76f63682646d430afe60cecf0568e75105fb09d5b8a3e73db8e8f0b9acb88","evidence":"reviews/codex-supervision/2026-10-05-batch-repair-execution/exact-reverification.json"}},"review_status":"CODEX_MATH_REVIEW_COMPLETE_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE","admitted":false,"animation_render_verified":false,"training_admitted":false,"render_verified":false,"animation_verified":false}
{"id":"draft-c46-02","category":"概率论","sub_category":"几何概型","concept":"几何概型","concept_id":"C46","parent_training_ids":["prob-039"],"problem":"在单位圆盘 $x^2+y^2\\le1$ 内随机取一点(均匀分布),求该点落入内接正方形 $|x|\\le\\frac{1}{\\sqrt2}$，$|y|\\le\\frac{1}{\\sqrt2}$ 的概率。","solution":"均匀分布下,概率等于面积比。内接正方形的边长为 $\\sqrt2$($\\frac{1}{\\sqrt2}\\times2$),面积为 $(\\sqrt2)^2=2$。单位圆盘面积为 $\\pi$。故所求概率为 $\\frac{2}{\\pi}$。","answer":"概率为 $\\frac{2}{\\pi}$。","method":"面积比(圆盘内接正方形)","difficulty":"基础","variant_kind":"区域切割:圆盘内正方形子区域的面积比","scene_spec":{"objects":["平面坐标系:单位圆盘(样本空间)","蓝色内接正方形 $|x|\\le\\frac{1}{\\sqrt2},|y|\\le\\frac{1}{\\sqrt2}$","正方形四个顶点落在圆周上的位置高亮(边长为 $\\sqrt2$)","板书:$\\frac{(\\sqrt2)^2}{\\pi}=\\frac{2}{\\pi}$","高亮框:$\\frac{2}{\\pi}$"],"steps":["第一步:画出单位圆盘。","第二步:画出内接正方形,标出顶点。","第三步:说明正方形边长为 $\\sqrt2$,面积为 $2$。","第四步:圆盘面积为 $\\pi$,计算面积比。","第五步:高亮结论 $\\frac{2}{\\pi}$。"]},"source":"self-authored","license":"Internal-Research-Use-Only","draft_status":"STAGED_NOT_ADMITTED","strict_review":{"status":"PENDING_NEW_VERSION_REVIEW","source_record_sha256":"31bfe2106ebb13ba5c6e5966459ccf926d542f2323f3d3dd975c2c7352d70a67","math_content_sha256":"c220978cf235b8e1868ff1c43cbc4e36d21fb75be1e28de817d4faa59167d59b","scene_semantic_review":"PENDING","visual_review":"PENDING"},"review_disposition":"MATH_VALID_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE","versioned_id":"codex-scene-completion-v5-draft-c46-02","revision_lineage":{"source_path":"reviews\\2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts\\batch-06\\draft.jsonl","source_sha256":"2685493ba0765d9a8d1f8a1be3e55595e83614f9d6861bc1b87c95e2d4aad8df","original_id":"draft-c46-02","prior_parent_training_ids":["prob-039"],"historical_risk_not_reset":true,"prior_corrected_record_sha256":"ab03fb997d939d8e5e9133e2330034237c7d156a359bf94081af94a7a467acae","previous_hold_reasons":[],"math_correction_notes":[],"revised_in_place":false,"version":"codex-repair-v4-final","additional_recheck_reason":null,"previous_selected_version":{"version":"codex-repair-v3","path":"reviews/2026-10-05-training-d