{"id":"draft-c46-03","category":"概率论","sub_category":"几何概型","concept":"几何概型","concept_id":"C46","parent_training_ids":["prob-039"],"problem":"从单位正方形均匀选取点$M=(X,Y)$。求$M$分别以$A=(0,0)$、$B=(1,0)$、$C=(0,1)$为三个点中唯一最近点的概率，证明平局不会改变结果。","solution":"比较平方距离：$MA^2\\le MB^2\\Leftrightarrow x\\le1/2$，$MA^2\\le MC^2\\Leftrightarrow y\\le1/2$，$MB^2\\le MC^2\\Leftrightarrow y\\le x$。所以$A$的区域为$[0,1/2]^2$，面积$1/4$；$B$的区域为$1/2\\le x\\le1,0\\le y\\le x$，面积$\\int_{1/2}^1x\\,dx=3/8$；$C$的区域关于$y=x$对称，面积亦为$3/8$。三面积和为$1$。平局只能位于垂直平分线$x=1/2,y=1/2,y=x$的线段上，其二维面积为零。联合分布连续且均匀，故唯一最近点的概率与非严格比较所得面积相同。","answer":"$P(A\\text{ uniquely nearest})=1/4$，$P(B\\text{ uniquely nearest})=P(C\\text{ uniquely nearest})=3/8$。","method":"三点Voronoi分区的几何概率","difficulty":"中等","variant_kind":"三个距离比较+三个区域+零测平局","scene_spec":{"objects":["单位正方形及三个参考点","$x=1/2,y=1/2,y=x$","区域概率$1/4,3/8,3/8$"],"steps":["第一步:把距离平方比较化成直线半平面。","第二步:交叠相应半平面得到三个区域。","第三步:求精确面积并检验和为一。","第四步:证明平局集合零测。"]},"source":"self-authored","license":"Internal-Research-Use-Only","draft_status":"STAGED_NOT_ADMITTED","strict_review":{"status":"PENDING_NEW_VERSION_REVIEW","source_record_sha256":"bd9682b73e745ad4fbe1fa0a06a2364c7fbb877e944849bad8b7a7ff781137bb","math_content_sha256":"5f1000ff38e9386eaeeeb7b6f84a9fe04a72974738be2da3001a83d78a7b6b55","scene_semantic_review":"PENDING","visual_review":"PENDING"},"review_disposition":"MATH_VALID_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE","versioned_id":"codex-scene-completion-v5-draft-c46-03","revision_lineage":{"source_path":"reviews\\2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts\\batch-06\\draft.jsonl","source_sha256":"2685493ba0765d9a8d1f8a1be3e55595e83614f9d6861bc1b87c95e2d4aad8df","original_id":"draft-c46-03","prior_parent_training_ids":["prob-039"],"historical_risk_not_reset":true,"prior_corrected_record_sha256":"fa5e7234c237ea8bcedda5bd0ceb6c1bd154fa374219b4886db68f4c9abfe1b9","previous_hold_reasons":["WITHIN_BATCH_VARIANT_CLUSTER_REVIEW"],"math_correction_notes":[],"revised_in_place":true,"version":"codex-repair-v4-final","additional_recheck_reason":null,"previous_selected_version":{"version":"codex-repair-v3","path":"reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-06/draft-codex-repair-v3.jsonl","sha256":"4a6de9211a9b74be83e8bdc6a6153ef4c7db3383674bb6d7832a8f0b26fc82bb","versioned_id":"codex-repair-20261005-batch-06-draft-c46-03"},"previous_math_review_binding":{"math_content_sha256":"e9370347d44c53760a8ffe957afd0874991bedd955b871a83aab52a3aa223290","evidence":"reviews/codex-supervision/2026-10-05-batch-repair-execution/exact-reverification.json"}},"review_status":"CODEX_MATH_REVIEW_COMPLETE_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE","admitted":false,"animation_render_verified":false,"training_admitted":false,"render_verified":false,"animation_verified":false}
{"id":"draft-c46-04","category":"概率论","sub_category":"几何概型","concept":"几何概型","concept_id":"C46","parent_training_ids":["prob-039"],"problem":"在单位正方形上取联合密度$f(x,y)=x+y$，其余地方为零。验证这是概率密度，求$P(X\\le1/2)$，并解释为什么此时不能直接用事件区域与正方形的普通面积之比。","solution":"$f\\ge0$且$\\int_0^1\\int_0^1(x+y)\\,dy\\,dx=\\int_0^1(x+1/2)\\,dx=1$，故密度有效。所求概率为$\\int_0^{1/2}\\int_0^1(x+y)\\,dy\\,dx=\\int_0^{1/2}(x+1/2)\\,dx=1/8+1/4=3/8$。事件区域的普通面积为$1/2$，但该分布不是均匀分布，所以普通面积比不是概率；正确几何表示是密度加权面积。边界线$x=1/2$零测，不影响结果。","answer":"密度归一化积分为$1$；$P(X\\le1/2)=3/8$，普通面积比$1/2$不适用。","method":"几何概率中均匀假设的适用边界","difficulty":"中等","variant_kind":"非均匀二维密度+加权面积反例","scene_spec":{"objects":["题面卡:$f(x,y)=x+y$ 在单位正方形上的概率","板书一:归一化积分的逐项计算","高亮框:关键点——$P(X\\le\\frac{1}{2})=\\int_0^{\\frac{1}{2}}(x+\\frac{1}{2})dx=\\frac{3}{8}$","对照板:普通面积比 $\\frac{1}{2}$ 与密度加权结果 $\\frac{3}{8}$","结论卡:非均匀分布用密度加权面积"],"steps":["第一步:归一化(逐项,高亮):$f\\ge0$;$\\int_0^1\\int_0^1(x+y)\\,dy\\,dx=\\int_0^1[xy+\\frac{y^2}{2}]_0^1dx=\\int_0^1(x+\\frac{1}{2})dx=[\\frac{x^2}{2}+\\frac{x}{2}]_0^1=1$;故密度有效。","第二步:所求概率(逐项):$P(X\\le\\frac{1}{2})=\\int_0^{\\frac{1}{2}}\\int_0^1(x+y)\\,dy\\,dx=\\int_0^{\\frac{1}{2}}(x+\\frac{1}{2})\\,dx$。","第三步:求值(逐步):$[\\frac{x^2}{2}+\\frac{x}{2}]_0^{\\frac{1}{2}}=\\frac{1}{8}+\\frac{1}{4}=\\frac{3}{8}$(高亮)。","第四步:对照:事件区域 $\\{x\\le\\frac{1}{2}\\}$ 的普通面积为 $\\frac{1}{2}$,但该分布不是均匀分布,面积比 $\\frac{1}{2}\\ne\\frac{3}{8}$。","第五步:结论(高亮):正确的几何表示是密度加权面积,不能直接用区域与正方形的普通面积之比。"]},"source":"self-authored","license":"Internal-Research-Use-Only","draft_status":"STAGED_NOT_ADMITTED","strict_review":{"status":"PENDING_NEW_VERSION_REVIEW","source_record_sha256":"9ff67852c98bd2fee5c9604db339ffbd24d052e4ea86b3bc80e5b8f892640a4f","math_content_sha256":"b9b3c24660a20f249e05997828beb5c978e8cb28c918a98a1f623530ae535ad6","scene_semantic_review":"PENDING","visual_review":"PENDING"},"review_disposition":"MATH_VALID_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE","versioned_id":"codex-scene-completion-v5-draft-c46-04","revision_lineage":{"source_path":"reviews\\2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts\\batch-06\\draft.jsonl","source_sha256":"2685493ba0765d9a8d1f8a1be3e55595e83614f9d6861bc1b87c95e2d4aad8df","original_id":"draft-c46-04","prior_parent_training_ids":["prob-039"],"historical_risk_not_reset":true,"prior_corrected_record_sha256":"add7f2c94b718e49a716e14762b496ee2d1203943fa81ce1b5fdbec9406390d5","previous_hold_reasons":["EXACT_FROZEN_TRANSFORM_SUBTASK"],"math_correction_notes":["用联合密度与雅可比严格证明均匀性，不只验证径向分布"],"revised_in_place":true,"version":"codex-repair-v4-final","additional_recheck_reason":null,"previous_selected_version":{"version":"codex-repair-v3","path":"reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-06/draft-codex-repair-v3.jsonl","sha256":"4a6de9211a9b74be83e8bdc6a6153ef4c7db3383674bb6d7832a8f0b26fc82bb","versioned_id":"codex-repair-20261005-batch-06-draft-c46-04"},"previous_math_review_binding":{"math_content_sha256":"f3e56ad52993f24b5a1b4db68e1e038c12194936fdd1a4f1c6d16ab0cdaf64c0","evidence":"reviews/codex-supervision/2026-10-05-batch-repair-execution/exact-reverification.json"}},"review_status":"CODEX_MATH_REVIEW_COMPLETE_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE","admitted":false,"animation_render_verified":false,"training_admitted":false,"render_verified":false,"animation_verified":false}
{"id":"draft-c46-05","category":"概率论","sub_category":"几何概型","concept":"几何概型","concept_id":"C46","parent_training_ids":["prob-039"],"problem":"$X,Y$相互独立且均匀分布于$[0,1]$。令$Z=\\{2X+3Y\\}$为小数部分，即$Z=2X+3Y-\\lfloor2X+3Y\\rfloor$。用单位正方形的原像面积证明$X,Z$相互独立且$Z$均匀分布于$[0,1]$，并求$P(X\\le1/3,Z\\le1/2)$。","solution":"对固定$x$和$0\\le b\\le1$，置$t=2x+3y$，则$dy=dt/3$，$t$扫过长度为$3$的区间$[2x,2x+3]$。函数$\\mathbf1_{\\{\\{t\\}\\le b\\}}$以$1$为周期，每周期积分为$b$，因而任意长度为$3$的区间积分为$3b$。故$\\int_0^1\\mathbf1_{\\{\\{2x+3y\\}\\le b\\}}\\,dy=b$。再积分$x$，对$0\\le a,b\\le1$有$P(X\\le a,Z\\le b)=\\int_0^a b\\,dx=ab$。取$a=1$得$Z$的均匀分布，乘积联合分布函数证明独立性。所求为$(1/3)(1/2)=1/6$。整数边界只有有限条直线，面积零；此结论来自精确的周期原像面积，不是抽样估计。","answer":"$P(X\\le a,Z\\le b)=ab$（$0\\le a,b\\le1$），故$X,Z$独立且均匀；$P(X\\le1/3,Z\\le1/2)=1/6$。","method":"多重环绕映射的原像面积","difficulty":"进阶","variant_kind":"三周期折返+条件截面长度+联合分布函数","scene_spec":{"objects":["单位正方形与$\\{2x+3y\\}\\le b$原像条带","长度三的周期区间","联合概率$ab$","具体事件概率$1/6$"],"steps":["第一步:固定$x$并作线性变量替换。","第二步:用周期性求每个纵截面的精确长度。","第三步:积分得到乘积联合分布函数。","第四步:验证独立性、边界零测及精确事件分数。"]},"source":"self-authored","license":"Internal-Research-Use-Only","draft_status":"STAGED_NOT_ADMITTED","strict_review":{"status":"PENDING_NEW_VERSION_REVIEW","source_record_sha256":"f3ec0b4f274d6327aadaa0faa6d38aa974ff2eb8449988d20afaa32c696d95a3","math_content_sha256":"d5ac6f6e09ac31877c0443adebe313524d6b1baa54fb6f0e303cc027be37ed13","scene_semantic_review":"PENDING","visual_review":"PENDING"},"review_disposition":"MATH_VALID_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE","versioned_id":"codex-scene-completion-v5-draft-c46-05","revision_lineage":{"source_path":"reviews\\2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts\\batch-06\\draft.jsonl","source_sha256":"2685493ba0765d9a8d1f8a1be3e55595e83614f9d6861bc1b87c95e2d4aad8df","original_id":"draft-c46-05","prior_parent_training_ids":["prob-039"],"historical_risk_not_reset":true,"prior_corrected_record_sha256":"93bdf4f37bc2fb5d315566ee02e3cea8196bc2b70df5217feb981881d46ee8ad","previous_hold_reasons":["EXACT_PROBLEM_AND_METHOD"],"math_correction_notes":["补Buffon投针的正长度、独立均匀模型；平面上不存在整体均匀概率分布"],"revised_in_place":true,"version":"codex-repair-v4-final","additional_recheck_reason":null,"previous_selected_version":{"version":"codex-repair-v3","path":"reviews/2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts/batch-06/draft-codex-repair-v3.jsonl","sha256":"4a6de9211a9b74be83e8bdc6a6153ef4c7db3383674bb6d7832a8f0b26fc82bb","versioned_id":"codex-repair-20261005-batch-06-draft-c46-05"},"previous_math_review_binding":{"math_content_sha256":"60d929979bd570c9483cd256755be8e4917806cdb066858bc11474de0c5410a6","evidence":"reviews/codex-supervision/2026-10-05-batch-repair-execution/exact-reverification.json"}},"review_status":"CODEX_MATH_REVIEW_COMPLETE_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE","admitted":false,"animation_render_verified":false,"training_admitted":false,"render_verified":false,"animation_verified":false}
